{"id":"19243b4c5c2eb016","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-pi11random-measure.md","title":"Pi11 随机类满测度","display":"thm-pi11random-measure — Pi11 随机类满测度","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-pi11random-measure","aliases":["43-thm-pi11random-measure"],"display":"thm-pi11random-measure — Pi11 随机类满测度","depends_on":["[[43-df-pi11random]]","[[43-df-measure]]","[[43-df-cylinder]]"],"source_edition":"书外补充；用户所供2007稿未涵盖","source_locator":"External: Chong–Nies–Yu, Def.3.1; https://www.cs.auckland.ac.nz/~nies/papers_till_09/ChongNiesYu_LownessHigherRandomness.pdf","verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"local_proof_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-pi11random-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-pi11random-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pi11random-measure — Pi11 随机类满测度"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bba47d15e357cf58\" href=\"?note=bba47d15e357cf58\" title=\"43-df-pi11random\">43-df-pi11random</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8e999d59227f4a28\" href=\"?note=8e999d59227f4a28\" title=\"43-df-measure\">43-df-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"书外补充；用户所供2007稿未涵盖"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"External: Chong–Nies–Yu, Def.3.1; <a href=\"https://www.cs.auckland.ac.nz/~nies/papers_till_09/ChongNiesYu_LownessHigherRandomness.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.cs.auckland.ac.nz/~nies/papers_till_09/ChongNiesYu_LownessHigherRandomness.pdf</a>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^1_1\\mathrm{Random}\">\\(\\Pi^1_1\\mathrm{Random}\\)</span> 与任意 Cantor 子集上的外测度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu^*\">\\(\\mu^*\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bba47d15e357cf58\" href=\"?note=bba47d15e357cf58\" title=\"43-df-pi11random\">43-df-pi11random</a>；其底层公平硬币 Borel 概率测度见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8e999d59227f4a28\" href=\"?note=8e999d59227f4a28\" title=\"43-df-measure\">43-df-measure</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a>。使用 lightface Π11 类的可数性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mu^*(2^\\omega\\setminus\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\Pi^1_1\\mathrm{Random}(X)\\})=0\\land\\mu^*(\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\Pi^1_1\\mathrm{Random}(X)\\})=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mu^*(2^\\omega\\setminus\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\Pi^1_1\\mathrm{Random}(X)\\})=0\\land\\mu^*(\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\Pi^1_1\\mathrm{Random}(X)\\})=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地证明：参数自由的递归树索引可数，故 Π11 零外测度类至多可数。每个这样的类均可取一个 Borel 零集覆盖（取测度趋零的 Borel 覆盖之交），这些覆盖的可数并仍是 Borel 零集，覆盖全部非随机点。因此非随机类外测度为0，而随机类包含一个 Borel 满测度集，故其外测度为1。补集外测度0也保证随机类在公平硬币测度的完备化中可测且测度1，未将“外测度1”单独冒充满测度。无需可计算枚举能判定哪些索引给零类。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-pi11random","status":"resolved","id":"bba47d15e357cf58","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pi11random]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"8e999d59227f4a28","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pi11random","status":"resolved","id":"bba47d15e357cf58","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Pi^1_1\\mathrm{Random}$ 与任意 Cantor 子集上的外测度 $\\mu^*$ 见 [[43-df-pi11random]]；其底层公平硬币 Borel 概率测度见 [[43-df-measure]]、[[43-df-cylinder]]。使用 lightface Π11 类的可数性。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"8e999d59227f4a28","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Pi^1_1\\mathrm{Random}$ 与任意 Cantor 子集上的外测度 $\\mu^*$ 见 [[43-df-pi11random]]；其底层公平硬币 Borel 概率测度见 [[43-df-measure]]、[[43-df-cylinder]]。使用 lightface Π11 类的可数性。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Pi^1_1\\mathrm{Random}$ 与任意 Cantor 子集上的外测度 $\\mu^*$ 见 [[43-df-pi11random]]；其底层公平硬币 Borel 概率测度见 [[43-df-measure]]、[[43-df-cylinder]]。使用 lightface Π11 类的可数性。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Pi^1_1\\mathrm{Random}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu^*(2^\\omega\\setminus\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\Pi^1_1\\mathrm{Random}(X)\\})=0\\land\\mu^*(\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\Pi^1_1\\mathrm{Random}(X)\\})=1.","display":true}],"bytes":1699,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-528","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-pi11random-measure]] — Pi11 随机类满测度"}],"outgoing":["bba47d15e357cf58","8e999d59227f4a28","ab1ef7b1cac112c1"]}